Z||000021||SWTKSTMS||06-08-2001||05:40 AM||||i used to have a 90 lx stang and got eaten up by my friends 86 gt with a 3.1 that was until about the time i hit 2nd gear. but that is in a lx. which is faster than the gts for the fact that they are lighter. im not one to stick up for mustangs but the late 80s and early 90s 5.0s are very fast at the stock level. they only have like 210 hp stock but the torque is higher than that. im not sure on the numbers of that but it will snap you back if they driver knows how to drive. but to sum it up first gear is ok in  a mustang but second is the gear that you should watch out for. ||||reg||1
